{"id":456,"gn":"Pokémon Poisson Ailé","ft":["La ligne qui fait le tour de son corps stocke l’énergie solaire et brille dans la nuit.","Après une longue exposition au soleil, les motifs de ses nageoires caudales luisent à la nuit tombée.","Il stocke les rayons solaires grâce aux parties roses de sa peau, qui brillent ensuite. Il s’agirait en fait d’une technique de camouflage.","Avec sa double nageoire caudale, il peut bondir hors de l’eau. C’est souvent à ce moment que les Goélise de passage l’attrapent et le gobent.","Les motifs roses de sa peau brillent la nuit. Des stations balnéaires l’attirent avec de la nourriture, car il est très aimé des plongeurs.","Il attire ses proies avec ses nageoires caudales lumineuses. Il passe la journée à la surface et se retire dans les abysses la nuit venue."],"fv":{"17":0,"18":0,"23":0,"24":1,"25":0,"26":1,"27":2,"28":3,"29":4,"30":5},"gr":4,"cr":190,"hc":20,"bh":70,"eg":["Aquatique 2"],"gw":"slow-then-very-fast","gm":{"svdisk":[0,83],"sv":[0,333,2,83],"la":[0,172],"bdsp":[0,134],"usum":[0,131],"usum*":[0,131,1,40,2,58,3,69],"sm":[0,108],"sm*":[0,108,1,40,2,55,3,57],"pt":[0,134],"dp":[0,134]},"f":{"456":{"n":"Écayon","t":["water"],"s":[49,49,56,49,61,66],"h":0.4,"w":7,"a":[[33,0],[114,0],[41,1]],"pa":[[4,[[33,0],[114,0]]]],"av":["svdisk","sv","la","bdsp","usum","sm","pt","dp"],"hi":[[164,5,[12,13,14,15,16,17,18,21,22]]],"ls":[{"l":[[1,1],[55,6],[240,13],[16,17],[352,22],[213,26],[219,29],[392,33],[250,38],[369,42],[340,45],[366,49],[487,54]],"m":[36,56,57,58,59,60,97,109,127,129,156,164,168,182,196,203,204,214,240,244,250,263,270,352,366,369,512,605,812,851,886,914],"e":[60,62,97,109,175,186,204,321,401]},{"l":[[145,1],[16,6],[352,11],[318,18],[403,25],[355,34],[56,43]]},{"l":[[1,1],[55,6],[213,10],[240,13],[16,17],[352,22],[175,26],[219,29],[392,33],[250,38],[369,42],[340,45],[366,49],[487,54]],"m":[57,58,59,104,127,148,156,164,182,203,207,213,214,219,240,244,258,263,352,362,369,371,432,503],"e":[60,62,97,109,150,175,186,204,32